===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈscɪlja/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɪlja|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|skildi|skilið}}

# {{lb|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[separate]]
# {{lb|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[understand]]
#: {{ux|is|[[ég skil ekki|Ég '''skil''' ekki]].|[[I don't understand|I don't '''understand''']].}}
